<div class="path"><h3>Just starting</h3><p>New to yoga? You’re welcome here. We’ll help you find a class that feels right. Start with one class and see how it feels.</p><a href="schedule.html#zapis">Book a first class</a></div>
<div class="path"><h3>Practising regularly</h3><p>Yoga and Pilates in one membership, consistent teachers and groups of up to 10, so your teacher has time to notice your practice and adjust it.</p><a href="pricing.html">See passes</a></div>
<div class="path"><h3>Looking for a gift</h3><p>A class voucher is a gift to use at one’s own pace. The recipient chooses yoga, Pilates or a mix of both. <mark class="inf" title="To confirm">(1–3 class voucher range to be confirmed)</mark></p><a href="vouchers.html">See vouchers</a></div></div></div></section><section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><h2>Kinds of practice</h2><div class="three styles"><div><h3>Vinyasa</h3><p><mark class="inf" title="To confirm">Movement linked smoothly with breath.</mark></p></div><div><h3>Hatha</h3><p><mark class="inf" title="To confirm">A calmer pace with attention to postures.</mark></p></div><div><h3>Ashtanga</h3><p><mark class="inf" title="To confirm">A set sequence of postures.</mark></p></div><div><h3>Pilates</h3><p><mark class="inf" title="To confirm">Controlled movement and strength work.</mark></p></div><div><h3>Specialised classes</h3><p>Mother-and-child, Ukrainian-language and outdoor yoga.</p></div><div><h3>Breath and sound</h3><p>Sound healing, breathwork, Kundalini and workshops.</p></div></div><p><a href="classes.html">All classes</a></p></div></section><section class=""><div class="wrap"><h2>How to start</h2><ol class="steps"><li><h3>Choose a class</h3><p>Check the schedule or send us a message and we’ll help you decide.</p></li><li><h3>Book a first class</h3><p>You book your place online in Fitssey. You can start with a single class.</p></li><li><h3>Continue if it feels right</h3><p>If you like the teacher and the group, a pass makes regular practice easier. Later you can try a workshop.</p></li></ol></div></section><section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><h2>Why Wisteria</h2><dl class="diff">
<div><dt>Groups of up to 10</dt><dd>Teachers have time to notice each student, offer corrections and adapt the practice.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Yoga and Pilates in one membership</dt><dd>Choose different kinds of practice through the week without joining separate studios.</dd></div>
<div><dt>A consistent teaching team</dt><dd>You get to know your teachers, and they get to know your level, needs and progress.</dd></div>
<div><dt>A clear path from beginner</dt><dd>You know where to start and how to progress without guessing the next step.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Classes in Ukrainian</dt><dd>Regular yoga classes in Ukrainian, a language you can feel at ease in.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Workshops, breathwork, sound</dt><dd>Kundalini, themed workshops, sound healing and breathwork in the same place.</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="three"><div><h3>Time for yourself</h3><p>An hour set aside for you, away from work and messages.</p></div>
<div><h3>Move with awareness</h3><p>We link postures with breathing and notice how the body feels.</p></div>
<div><h3>No pressure</h3><p>You don’t have to get every pose right or compare yourself with anyone. Work at your own pace.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><div class="two"><div><h2>What Wisteria is not</h2><ul class="plain"><li>We’re not a high-volume studio. We limit class sizes.</li><li>We don’t expect flexibility, strength or experience.</li><li>We don’t promise quick results. We value consistent practice and gradual progress.</li></ul></div>
<div><h2>Where to find us</h2><p>Dobra 14/16, <mark class="ph" data-key="postcode">[postcode]</mark> Warsaw</p><p>Classes run on weekdays and weekends, including evenings. You book your place online in Fitssey.</p><div class="btns"><a class="btn ph-link" href="#" title="[Fitssey link]" onclick="return false">Book in Fitssey</a><a class="btn ghost" href="https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Dobra%2014/16%2C%20Warszawa%2C%20Polska" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Directions in Google Maps</a></div></div></div></div></section><section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="band"><h2>Start with one class</h2><div class="btns" style="justify-content:center"><a class="btn" href="schedule.html#zapis" data-track="band_enrol">Book your first class</a><a class="btn ghost" href="contact.html">Have a question? Write to us</a></div></div></div></section></main>
