<main id="main"><div class="pagehead"><div class="wrap"><h1>Classes</h1><p>What you can practise with us and who each format is for.</p></div></div><section class=""><div class="wrap"><div class="offer"><h3>Regular Yoga & Pilates classes</h3><div><p>60-minute instructor-led group classes for beginners and regular practitioners. Groups have a maximum of 10 people.</p>
<ul class="plain"><li><strong>Vinyasa</strong> <mark class="inf" title="To confirm">– movement linked smoothly with breath.</mark></li><li><strong>Hatha</strong> <mark class="inf" title="To confirm">– a calmer pace with attention to postures.</mark></li><li><strong>Ashtanga</strong> <mark class="inf" title="To confirm">– a set sequence of postures.</mark></li><li><strong>Pilates</strong> <mark class="inf" title="To confirm">– controlled movement and strength work.</mark></li></ul></div></div><div class="offer"><h3>Passes & memberships</h3><div><p>Passes for 3, 4 or 8 classes, or unlimited access, valid for a set period. For people who want to practise regularly. <a href="pricing.html">Pricing</a></p></div></div><div class="offer"><h3>Specialised classes</h3><div><ul class="plain"><li>Mother-and-child yoga</li><li>Ukrainian-language yoga</li><li>Outdoor yoga</li></ul></div></div><div class="offer"><h3>Private & couples yoga</h3><div><p>60-minute sessions for one person or two. For those who want personal instruction or to practise together.</p><a href="schedule.html#zapis">Ask about a time</a></div></div><div class="offer"><h3>Workshops & Kundalini</h3><div><p>Special sessions and themed workshops for those who want a deeper practice. <a href="workshops.html">Workshops</a></p></div></div><div class="offer"><h3>Sound healing & breathwork</h3><div><p>Sound relaxation and breathing sessions for those seeking calm and relief from stress.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="alt"><div class="wrap"><h2>Not sure where to start?</h2><p>Send us a message and we’ll help you decide.</p><a class="btn" href="schedule.html#zapis">Ask for help choosing</a></div></section></main>
